text = "MEMO TO ALL STAFF:

LOWER FLOORS MUST BE TEMPORARILY EVACUATED
DUE TO CRITICAL DAMAGE IN OUR DRIP 
IRRIGATION SYSTEMS. 

THIS IS NOT A CAUSE FOR CONCERN. HOWEVER,
PLEASE TAKE ANY CRITICAL RESEARCH MATERIAL
WITH YOU, AS SOME LIGHT FLOODING IS
EXPECTED. YOU WILL BE NOTIFIED WHEN 
REPAIRS ARE COMPLETE, AND WHEN IT IS THUS
SAFE TO RETURN TO THE PAPER LABS.

TO ENSURE REPAIRS ARE COMPLETE AS QUICKLY
AS POSSIBLE, PLEASE DO NOT INTERFERE WITH
ANY UNIFORMED PERSONNEL ENTERING
OR EXITING THE AFFECTED LOWER FLOORS, OR
WHO ARE COLLECTING RELEVANT MATERIAL FROM
YOUR OFFICES OR YOUR PERSONS.

YOUR UNDERSTANDING AND COMPLIANCE ARE
APPRECIATED. "
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_wuxxj")

