IMMINENT. AUTOMATED SECURITY WILL BE
ACTIVATED AND ALL CREDENTIALS REMOVED
WITHIN 24 HOURS. 

ANY PERSONNEL FOUND WITHIN 10 MILES OF 
FACILITY WILL HAVE CONTRACT TERMINATED,
POLICY EFFECTIVE UPON LOCKDOWN AND 
IN PERPETUITY. 

ALL DEVELOPMENT OF STRANGLER FIG PAPER
FARM TO HALT IMMEDIATELY --- TEAM 
MEMBERS TO BE REASSIGNED.

AND PLEASE RECALL, YOUR NDAS STILL APPLY.

"
